{
  "schema": "odc-bridge-deadlines/1",
  "about": "The one table of the ODC bridge's deadlines. The bridge and its .NET client embed this file (BridgeDeadlines.cs); the facade reads it (odc-pipe.mjs) and sends each reply deadline to the agent (timeoutMs of odc.pipe). A client always waits past the bridge: clientMs = max(clientFloorSeconds, bridge + clientMarginSeconds, the wait the call asks for + clientMarginSeconds). The samples are checked by both sides.",
